    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Nurses at Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH) celebrated the 'International Nurses Day' on June 1, 2001. The day is observed every year across the world in commemoration of Florence Nightingale, Lady with the Lamp. This year, the day was marked by the theme: \"Is Violence A Preventable Disease In Health Care Settings In Pakistan?\"",
